きてね\nカメラロールを見返してて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらたくさん写真が眠っててね\n寝てたい子もいるかもなんだけど\n起こしてみちゃおうかなって思ったので\n何枚か起こしてみるね🌬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mobWNGYX9.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mobJlGGhp.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やあ! って言ってそうだね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mob6rjiSa.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mobo5AUlw.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなお姉ちゃんが撮ってくれたときの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mobM8P2cX.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mobNq1HFR.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202411/mobPZLo64.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なとき🪷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はミーグリ!\nもう少しではじまるねー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみでウッキウキだよ\n待ってるね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ˶˙ᵕ˙˶ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra